    <section class="section-content read-more-option flex-wrap bg-sec-blue" id="optional-add-ons">
        <div class="il-container">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Why Renew Car Insurance Before Expiry?</h2>
            <p class="sub-txt   align-center">Because it helps you to avoid unnecessary risks and extra costs. Here are six reasons why you should always renew your car insurance before its expiry: </p>
            <div class="row-block mt-20">
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/avoid_legal_issues.webp" alt="Avoid Legal Issues" title="Avoid Legal Issues" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Avoid Legal Issues</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Driving without a valid car insurance policy is illegal in India and can lead to fines or penalties. Renewing on time keeps you compliant with the law. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/avoid_policy_lapse.webp" alt="Avoid Policy Lapse" title="Avoid Policy Lapse" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Avoid Policy Lapse</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">This means your car is not covered against own damages and third-party liabilities. Without an active policy, even minor accidents can lead to high out-of-pocket expenses.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/incur_repair_cost.webp" alt="Incur Repair Cost" title="Incur Repair Cost" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Incur Repair Cost</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Car repairs can be expensive and you will have to bear these costs straight out of your pocket if you don’t renew your car insurance policy on time.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item  more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/retain_your_ncb.webp" alt="Retain Your NCB" title="Retain Your NCB" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Retain Your NCB </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">You can lose your accumulated NCB if you don’t renew your car insurance policy before it expires. This can also result in an increase in premium.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item  more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/get_better_discounts.webp" alt="Get Better Discounts" title="Get Better Discounts" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Get Better Discounts</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10"> Insurance companies often offer better deals and renewal discounts as a reward for renewing your policy.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item  more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/break_in_inspection.webp" alt="Avoid Car Inspection " title="Avoid Car Inspection" class="lazy ">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Avoid Car Inspection </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Renewing your car insurance on time usually eliminates the need for vehicle inspection, saving you time and effort.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>




            </div>

             <a role="button" class="read-more-opt-btn read-more-desk-hide">Read more</a>
