      <a role="button" class="read-more-opt-btn">Read more</a> -->

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content bg-coolgray" id="what-are-benifits-renew-car">
        <div class="il-container">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">What are the Benefits of Renewing Car Insurance Online?</h2>
            <p class="text align-center">Renewing your car insurance online is a faster, smarter and more convenient way to stay protected. And when you renew your policy online via our website, you enjoy the following benefits:</p>

            <div class="flex-div mt-40 read-more-list">
                <div class="list-block org-list width-equal org-list-block">
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">No Paperwork </h4>
                            <p class="text">With the entire renewal process being completely digital, you don’t have to submit any documents or forms to renew your car insurance online. </p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Easy Customisation</h4>
                            <p class="text">You can easily customise your car insurance policy by modifying your IDV or adding add-ons based on your current driving needs.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Instant Coverage</h4>
                            <p class="text">You just need to review your coverage details, make any modifications (if required) and make the payment. That’s it. Your policy will be renewed instantly.</p>
                        </li>

                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="list-block org-list width-equal org-list-block">
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Access to Discounts </h4>
                            <p class="text">You can make the most of renewal discounts and promotional offers to reduce your payable premium whilst enjoying full coverage.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Option to Port</h4>
                            <p class="text">You can port your policy if you’re not happy with your current insurer during renewal without losing out on your NCB. </p>
                        </li>

                    </ul>
                </div>
                <!-- <a role="button" class="read-more-link">Read more</a> -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="premium-section section-content bg-pink" id="How-to-renew-car-insu-Online">
        <div class="il-container">

            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">How to Renew Car Insurance Online?</h2>
            <p class="sub-txt mid-width width-90 align-center">
                Renewing your car insurance online is quite simple and hassle-free. You can complete the entire process within minutes, without any paperwork. Just follow the below steps:
            </p>

            <div class="steps">

                <div class="step-card">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/how_to_renew_step1.webp" alt="Visit ICICI Lombard Website For Renewal" title="Visit ICICI Lombard Website For Renewal" class="lazy ">
                    
                    <span class="step">Step 1</span>
                    <span class="step stephead">Visit Our Website</span>
                    <p class="text align-center"> Visit our website, click on the “Renewal” tab and select “Car Policy Renewal”. Alternatively, you can directly visit our <a target="_blank" class="link" href="/motor-insurance/car-insurance/renewal/">renewal </a>page.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="step-card">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/how_to_renew_step2.webp" alt="Enter Car Registration Or Policy No" title="Enter Car Registration Or Policy No" class="lazy ">
                      <span class="step">Step 2</span>
                    <span class="step stephead">Fill Details</span>
                    <p class="text align-center">Enter details like your car registration number or policy number.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="step-card">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/how_to_renew_step3.webp" alt="Review Coverage Details" title="Review Coverage Details" class="lazy ">
                      <span class="step">Step 3</span>
                    <span class="step stephead">Check Coverage</span>
                    <p class="text align-center">Review your coverage details and make changes like adjust IDV or opt for add-ons.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step-card">
                    <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/how_to_renew_step4.webp" alt="Make Payment For Car Insurance Renewal" title="Make Payment For Car Insurance Renewal" class="lazy ">
                      <span class="step">Step 4</span>
                    <span class="step stephead">Make Payment</span>
                    <p class="text align-center">Pay the applicable premium to renew your car insurance instantly.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            <p class="sub-txt mt-20 align-center ">Note that a car with an expired car insurance policy can also be renewed. You may have to complete a physical or online inspection where the insurer checks the condition of your four-wheeler.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content owl-div " id="how-to-file-car-claim-online">
        <div class="il-container">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">How to File a Car Insurance Claim Online?</h2>
            <!-- <p class="text align-center">Filing a two-wheeler insurance claim is quick and simple. Just follow these steps:</p> -->
            <div class="grad-block">
                <div class="grad-sec ">
                    <div class="grad-item">
                        <div class="ico-block">
                            <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/inform_us.webp" alt="Car Insurance Claim - Inform Us" title="Car Insurance Claim - Inform Us" class="lazy ">
                        </div>
                        <div class="grad-cont">
                            <p class="color-steps">Step 1</p>
                            <h3 class="heading3">Inform us</h3>
                            <p class="text">Intimate ICICI Lombard about the damage, theft or loss as soon as possible after the incident. You can do this online via our website, or through the IL TakeCare app, or by calling the toll-free number 1800 2666 or contacting
                                us on WhatsApp: 7738282666. </p>

                            <!-- <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/elevate-health-policy?opt=elevate&amp;source=nav" class="know-more-link" target="_blank">Know More</a> -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grad-item">
                        <div class="ico-block">
                            <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/complete_video_survey.webp" alt="Car Insurance Claim - Video Survey" title="Car Insurance Claim - Video Survey" class="lazy ">
                        </div>
                        <div class="grad-cont">
                            <p class="color-steps">Step 2</p>
                            <h3 class="heading3">Complete Video Survey: </h3>
                            <p class="text">Log into our IL TakeCare App and complete your video survey using the InstaSpect# option. </p>

                            <!-- <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/health-booster?opt=ab&amp;source=nav" class="know-more-link" target="_blank">Know More</a> -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grad-item">
                        <div class="ico-block">
                            <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/submit_documents.webp" alt="Car Insurance Claim - Submit Documents" title="Car Insurance Claim - Submit Documents" class="lazy ">
                        </div>
                        <div class="grad-cont">
                            <p class="color-steps">Step 3</p>
                            <h3 class="heading3">Submit Documents </h3>
                            <p class="text"> Upload or submit essential documents such as car registration certificate (RC), driving licence, filled claim form and FIR (for theft cases). </p>

                            <!-- <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/activate-booster-combo?opt=abcartemis&amp;source=nav" class="know-more-link" target="_blank">Know More</a> -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grad-item">
                        <div class="ico-block">
                            <img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/track_your_claim.webp" alt="Track Your Car Insurance Claim" title="Track Your Car Insurance Claim" class="lazy ">
                        </div>
                        <div class="grad-cont">
                            <p class="color-steps">Step 4</p>
                            <h3 class="heading3">Track Your Claim</h3>
                            <p class="text">You can check the status of your car insurance claim on our website or WhatsApp or via the IL TakeCare app using your policy number and registered mobile number.</p>

                            <!-- <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/health-insurance/max-protect-1-crore-health-insurance?opt=max&amp;source=nav" class="know-more-link" target="_blank">Know More</a> -->
                        </div>
                    </div>

                     <p class="sub-txt mt-25">Note: Be prepared beforehand: Get more information about the <a href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions" class="link" target="_blank">claim process and document required</a>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content bg-sec-blue" id="how-to-file-cashless-car-claim">
        <div class="il-container">
            <div class="mid-width width-90">
                <h2 class="heading2 ">How to File a Cashless Car Insurance Claim?</h2>
                <p class="text width-90">Accidents can be stressful but filing a <a href="/motor-insurance/car-insurance/cashless-car-insurance" target="_blank" class="link">cashless car insurance</a>  claim shouldn’t be. That’s why ICICI Lombard offers a seamless claims experience. Just follow these steps:</p>
                <div class="list-block org-list org-list-block mt-20">
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Inform About Incident </h4>
                            <p class="text">Inform us about the accident via website, IL TakeCare app, toll-free number 1800 2666 or WhatsApp: 7738282666. Share basic details like your policy number, chassis/vehicle registration number and the nature of damage.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">	Visit Network Garage</h4>
                            <p class="text">Take your car to one of our network garages to avail the benefit of cashless repairs. With this, you don’t have to make any upfront payment for the repairs (subject to policy terms and conditions).</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">	Submit Documents:</h4>
                            <p class="text">Upload or submit documents such as car registration certificate (RC), driving licence, filled claim form and FIR (for theft cases), and other as requested by the insurer.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Complete Video Survey: </h4>
                            <p class="text"> Complete your video survey using the InstaSpect# on our IL TakeCare App. This will help us assess the damage and speed up the claim process.</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <h4 class="heading4">Claim Settlement </h4>
                            <p class="text">Once your car is repaired, we settle the bill directly with the network garage as per policy terms. You only need to pay for deductibles or non-covered items.</p>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <!-- <a href="#" class="calculate-primium-btn primary-btn">Calculate Premium Now </a> -->
                </div>
                <p class="sub-txt mt-25">Note: Be prepared beforehand: Get more information about the <a href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions" class="link" target="_blank">claim process and document required</a>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content" id="doc-require-claim">
        <div class="il-container">
            <div class="cont-img-block flex-div">
                <div class="img-block">
                    <img alt="Documents Required For Car Insurance Claim" title="Documents Required For Car Insurance Claim" class="img-hide lazy" width="450" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/documents_required.webp">
                </div>
                <div class="cont-block width-50">
                    <h2 class="heading2">Documents Required for Filing a Car Insurance Claim</h2>
                    <p class="text mt-10 doc-txt-para">Filing a car insurance claim can be quite simple if you keep the right documents ready with you. This will help to speed up the claims process. Here’s a quick look at the documents you’ll need to file a car insurance claim smoothly.
                    </p>
                    <div class="list-block org-list mt-20">
                        <ul>
                            <!-- <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Policy Documents </span>A copy of your active bike insurance policy to
                verify coverage details.</li> -->
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Identification Proofs:  </span>Certified copy of one officially valid document &amp; PAN card/form 60.&nbsp;</li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Claim Form:  </span>A duly filled and signed claim form with NEFT mandate form/cancelled cheque.</li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Registration Certificate (RC):  </span>Your car’s valid RC to confirm ownership.&nbsp;</li>

                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Driving Licence:  </span>A copy of the licence of the person driving at the time of the incident.</li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">FIR/Police Report: </span>This is mandatory for theft claims or if a third party is involved.</li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Repair Bills and Invoices:  </span>Original garage estimate and final repair bills.
                            </li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">Form 28/29/30:  </span>These are required in case of total loss or salvage situations.
                            </li>
                            <li class="text"><span class="strong-txt">No Objection Certificate (NOC): </span>Needed if the car is under loan or finance.</li>

                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text mt-30"><span class="strong-txt">Note: </span>Check the full list of <a target="_blank" class="link" href="/docs/default-source/default-document-library/motor-odpt-claims-document-checklist.pdf"> documents</a>.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-content  bg-pink" id="what-are-common-reason-claim-reject">
        <div class="il-container read-more-option">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">What are Some Common Reasons for Car Insurance Claim Rejection?</h2>
            <p class="text align-center"> Filing a car insurance claim can be stressful and rejection makes it worse. Did you know your car insurance claim can be rejected if certain policy terms and conditions are not met? That’s true. Most claims get rejected due to the following
                avoidable reasons:</p>
            <div class="option-block ">
                <div class="option-item">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Driving Under Influence</h3>
                    <p class="text"> Your car insurance claim will be rejected if the driver was under the influence of alcohol or drugs at the time of the accident.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="option-item">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Driving Without Licence</h3>
                    <p class="text"> Insurers do not honour claims if the person driving the insured car does not have a valid driving licence.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="option-item">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Driving With Expired Policy:</h3>
                    <p class="text"> Another key reason for claim rejection is driving a four-wheeler with an expired car insurance policy. Insurers do not cover you or your vehicle when your policy is lapsed.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="option-item ">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Misrepresentation</h3>
                    <p class="text">Providing incorrect or incomplete information while buying the car insurance policy or filing a claim can result in rejection.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="option-item ">
                    <h3 class="heading3">	Wear and Tear-Related Claims</h3>
                    <p class="text">Insurance companies also do not cover damages caused by normal wear and tear or ageing of vehicle parts. </p>
                </div>
                <div class="option-item ">
                    <h3 class="heading3">Driving Outside Covered Area </h3>
                    <p class="text">Car insurance claims usually get rejected if the accident occurs outside the geographical limits mentioned in the policy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- <a role="button" class="read-more-opt-btn">Read more</a> -->
        </div>
    </section>

