    <section class="section-content read-more-option flex-wrap " id="importance-of-terminology">
        <div class="il-container">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Important Car Insurance Terminologies You Need to Know</h2>
            <div class="row-block mt-20">
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="Understand Car Insurance Premium" title="Understand Car Insurance Premium" class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/premium.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Premium</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Premium is the amount you need to pay for getting car insurance coverage.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="Total Loss In Car Insurance" title="Total Loss In Car Insurance" class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/total_loss.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Total Loss</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Total Loss occurs when your insured car is stolen or damaged beyond repair. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="Car Insurance - Break-in Inspection" title="Car Insurance - Break-in Inspection" class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/break_in_inspection.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Break-in Inspection </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">This is required when there’s a gap or lapse in car insurance policy coverage.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item ">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="Car Insurance - Consequential Loss" title="Car Insurance - Consequential Loss" class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/consequential_loss.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Consequential Loss </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">This refers to any indirect loss caused to your insured vehicle due to negligence.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item ">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="IDV In Car Insurance " title="IDV In Car Insurance " class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/idv.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">IDV</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">IDV is your car’s current market value and the maximum payout in case of total loss or theft of vehicle.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item ">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img alt="Deductible In Car Insurance " title="Deductible In Car Insurance " class="lazy" width="50" data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/deductible.webp">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Deductible </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">Deductible is the portion of the claim amount you have to pay from your own pocket.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- <div class="row-item more-option-show">
          <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/health-revamp/power-booster.webp" alt="Power Booster" title="Power Booster"></div>
          <div class="row-cont">
            <h3 class="heading3">NCB Protect</h3>
            <p class="text mt-10">This add-on allows you to retain a significant portion of your No Claim Bonus (NCB) even after making a claim during the policy year. Note that you will lose all your NCB if you lodge more than three claims during a policy year.   </p>
          </div>
        </div> -->
                <div class="row-item more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/no-claim-bonus-ncb.webp" alt="Car Insurance - No Claim Bonus" title="No Claim Bonus In Car Insurance" class="lazy" width="50">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">No Claim Bonus (NCB)</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">It is the discount you get on your own damage premium for every claim-free year. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/depreciation.webp" alt="Car Value Depreciation " title="Car Value Depreciation" class="lazy" width="50">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Depreciation </h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">This refers to the decrease in the market value of your car and its parts due to age and normal wear and tear. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row-item more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/garage-cash.webp" alt="Cashless Claims In Car Insurance" title="Cashless Claims In Car Insurance" class="lazy" width="50">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Cashless Claims</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">These claims allow car repairs to be done at network garages without upfront payment as per policy terms and conditions.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="row-item more-option-show">
                    <div class="img-wrap"><img data-src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/motor-fw-revamp/third-party.webp" alt="Understand Third Party" title="Understand Third Party" class="lazy" width="50">
                    </div>
                    <div class="row-cont">
                        <h3 class="heading3">Third Party</h3>
                        <p class="text mt-10">A third party is any person or property other than you and your insured car.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>


            </div>
            <!-- <p class="note-txt">Note: Kindly go through the  <a href="https://www.icicilombard.com/downloads" class="link" target="_blank">policy wordings</a> for detailed information about different two-wheeler add-ons offered by ICICI Lombard. You can check the complete list of add-on covers in this <a href="/docs/default-source/default-document-library/two-wheeler-products-add-on-and-uin.pdf" class="link" target="_blank">document</a>.</p> -->
            <a role="button" class="read-more-opt-btn">Read more</a>

        </div>
    </section>


</div>



