</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><section class="section-content bg-coolgray tab-accord-sec" id="faq-sec">
  <div class="il-container">
    <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Frequently Asked Questions About Car Insurance</h2>
    <div class="tab-sec">
      <ul>
        <li class="active" id="general">
          <span>General</span>
        </li>
        <li id="Cover">
          <span>Cover</span>
        </li>
        <li id="premium" class="">
          <span>Premium</span>
        </li>
        <li id="claims" class="">
          <span>Claims</span>
        </li>
        <li id="renewal" class="">
          <span>Renewal</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="accord-wrap">
      <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="general">
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Why do I need to insure my car?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You need a car insurance to protect you and your four-wheeler during any untoward incidents. While a third-party car insurance is compulsory for all car owners in India, an own damage car insurance covers you in case of accidents, theft and fire. </p>
            <!-- <div class="list-block arrow-list faq"><ul class="mt-15"><li class="text mb-10">Enter the vehicle registration number and your contact details</li><li class="text mb-10">Review instant quote received for your motor insurance policy based on your vehicle type </li><li class="text mb-10">Pay the premium if you’re happy with the quote</li><li class="text mb-10">View and download the policy instantly online.</li></ul></div><p>When you buy vehicle insurance online, remember to look for add-on features that suit your needs.</p> -->
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the different types of car insurance policies? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">There are three types of car insurance policies, namely third-party car insurance, own damage car insurance and comprehensive car insurance. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the benefits of buying car insurance online?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">When you buy car insurance online, you get an instant coverage, easy customisation and better discounts. You also have the advantage of choosing from multiple payment options, e.g. credit card (Visa, Master, AMEX card), net banking, debit card etc. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How quickly can I buy/renew car insurance online?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">It takes just a few minutes to buy or renew car insurance online. You just have to enter your vehicle registration number, contact information and select the covers you need. Once you make the payment, you receive an instant car insurance policy. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the various types of vehicles that I can insure online? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can buy car insurance online for private cars, including petrol, diesel and CNG, and electric vehicles. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Do I need a valid PUC to drive in India?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, you need to have a valid and effective PUC, and/or fitness certificate, to drive your vehicle and stay compliant with the law. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I skip the ₹15 lakh Personal Accident cover for owner in my car insurance policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, but only if you already have an existing personal accident cover or accidental cover rider in your life/term insurance. </p>
            <p class="text mt-20">What are the base products available, and how can I access their relevant policy documents? </p>
            <div class="table-style1  mt-30 faq-table">
              <table class="table-wrap">
                <thead>
