                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What are the risks covered by Private Car Package Insurance Policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">A Private Car Package Policy or comprehensive car insurance offers coverage for both own damages and third-party liabilities. The covered risks include accidents, theft, natural and man-made calamities, fire, third-party property damages and liabilities. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">I am the car's second owner and want to book a fresh policy in my name. What is the process? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You need to first transfer the ownership of the car in the registration certificate. Once this is done, you can buy a new car insurance policy under your name. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I switch to ICICI Lombard at the time of renewal from another insurer? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, you can easily port your car insurance policy without losing your accumulated NCB. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is an endorsement in car insurance?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">An endorsement is written evidence of an agreed change in the car insurance policy. It is a document that incorporates changes in the policy terms. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Where can I check my car insurance policy details?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can check all your car insurance details in your policy documents. You can also log in to our website or IL TakeCare app to check the below details: </p>
            <div class="list-block arrow-list faq">
              <ul class="mt-15">
                <li class="text mb-10">Policy number</li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Policy start and end date</li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Policy type (Comprehensive/OD only/TP only)</li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Engine &amp; chassis number</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="Cover">
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is third party liability cover in a car insurance? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">It covers losses to a third person caused by your insured car. Specifically, it covers: </p>
            <div class="list-block arrow-list faq">
              <ul class="mt-15">
                <li class="text mb-10">Any permanent injury/death to a person caused by your insured vehicle </li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Any damage caused to the property of some other individual, by your insured vehicle </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is Zero Depreciation Cover in a car insurance policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Zero Depreciation Cover is a car insurance add-on that protects you from bearing the cost of depreciation on car parts during a claim. Usually, when you file a claim, the insurer deducts depreciation from the value of the parts that are repaired or replaced, and you end up paying that amount out of your pocket. With Zero Depreciation Cover, the insurer covers this depreciation cost, ensuring you receive a higher claim amount and significantly reducing your out‑of‑pocket expenses. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is covered under Zero Depreciation?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Zero Depreciation add-on covers the repair and replacement costs of fiber part, rubber, batteries, airbags, nylon and plastic parts, denting, painting, and fiber glass as per policy terms and conditions. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Do we cover engine in Zero Depreciation?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, we do. However, this coverage is only applicable in case of accidental damage to the engine. You can opt for the Engine Protect Plus add-on if you want coverage for consequential losses to the engine. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is Engine Protect Plus?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">It is a car insurance add-on that covers the cost of repairing or replacing an engine, which was damaged due to water ingression/leakage of lubricating oil. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is Key Protect cover in car insurance?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">It is an add-on that covers your car keys and locks against theft or damage. The Key Protect add-on pays for repair or replacement of lost or damaged keys and locks, including locksmith charges. You can opt for this cover in your policy by paying a nominal additional premium. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is Garage Cash cover?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Garage Cash is an add-on that offers pay a fixed daily allowance when your car is under repair in an authorised garage after an accident. You can use it for alternative transport. Please refer to the policy wordings for terms and conditions. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does the ICICI Lombard car insurance policy cover partial theft? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, we cover both complete and partial theft under a car insurance policy's own damage section (subject to terms and conditions). </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Do you cover rat bites in the policy?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, we do cover rat bites as per terms and conditions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Do you cover damage due to a hit by a coconut or cricket bat? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, we do.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Are passengers covered under car insurance?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Only if you have bought an additional Personal Accident Cover for passengers. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Does car insurance cover natural disasters like floods and earthquakes? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, car insurance covers</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="premium">
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What factors affect my premium amount?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Your car insurance premium is impacted by your vehicle’s IDV, age, geographical location, make and model, fuel type, claim history and add-ons opted. </p>
            <app-faq-premium-calculate></app-faq-premium-calculate>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is IDV (Insured Declared Value) in a car insurance policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">IDV is your car’s market value after depreciation. It is one of the key factors that determines your claim payout. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How is the Insured Declared Value (IDV) of my vehicle decided and how does it impact my coverage? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">IDV is calculated using the manufacturer’s list price minus depreciation (based on the vehicle’s age). It affects both your premium and the maximum amount you can receive in case of total loss or theft. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is the meaning of deductible in a car insurance policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Deductible is the amount you pay during a claim before the insurer settles the rest. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is there any discount on the car insurance premium if I install an anti-theft alarm and locking system? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, insurers generally provide upto 2.5% discount on car insurance premium for installing approved anti-theft devices. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is my No Claim Bonus (NCB) transferable?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You cannot transfer your accumulated NCB to someone else. However, you can retain your NCB even after porting your car insurance policy. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Will my NCB be impacted if I claim for Loss of Personal Belongings &amp; Key Protect add-ons? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">No.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I reduce my premium by opting for a voluntary deductible? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes, opting for a higher deductible lowers your car insurance premium but it also increases your out-of-pocket expenses during claims </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="claims">
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Why should I notify my claim to the insurer directly?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">It ensure faster claim processing and avoid rejection of admissible claims. If intimate the claim with us before going to the garage, you can get these benefits at our certified preferred garages: </p>
            <div class="list-block arrow-list faq">
              <ul class="mt-15">
                <li class="text mb-10"> Quick survey </li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Quality assuranceI for repairs done under claim for 24 months or 10000 km, whichever is earlier </li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Complimentary vehicle body wash</li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Complimentary sanitisation - on major touchpoints</li>
                <li class="text mb-10">Complimentary towing at the time of the accident</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How do I register my claim?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can file a car insurance claim online via our <a href="/motor-insurance-claims#/claimOptions" class="link" target="_blank">website</a> , through the IL TakeCare app, or by calling the toll-free number 1800 2666 or contacting us on WhatsApp: 7738282666. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What is a cashless claim and a non-cashless/reimbursement claim? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Under the cashless claim facility, we pay our share of the vehicle repair charges directly to the garage, provided the vehicle is repaired in our network garage. Whereas if the vehicle is repaired in a garage outside our network's purview, you will have to pay the repair charges to the garage. You can get your claim amount reimbursed by submitting the original bills and payment receipts to our office. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How many times can we claim under car insurance in a year? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can make any number of claims in the year.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What documents are required to file a car insurance claim? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Some of important <a href="/docs/default-source/default-document-library/motor-odpt-claims-document-checklist.pdf" target="_blank" class="link">documents</a> required to file a car insurance claim include RC, driving licence, FIR (if applicable), claim form and repair bills. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Why can a car insurance claim be rejected?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Your claim can be rejected due to multiple reasons, including policy lapse, misrepresentation or illegal driving. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="accordian-block accord-sec" data-rel="renewal">
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">When should I renew car insurance?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You need to renew car insurance before it expires, so that there is no break in coverage. In case of a gap between expiry and renewal, you may lose out on claims and your accumulated NCB. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">I am an existing ICICI Lombard customer. Can I renew my car insurance policy online? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You, can renew your car insurance policy by visiting our <a href="/motor-insurance/car-insurance/renewal/" target="_blank" class="link">website</a>. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Can I renew my car insurance after expiry?</h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Ideally, you should renew your car insurance policy before expiry of the previous policy. In case your vehicle insurance policy has already expired, our authorised surveyor would require an inspection of the car, before policy issuance. The policy would only be issued subject to satisfactory inspection and submission of required documents. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Is inspection required if my car insurance policy has expired? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">Yes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">Where can I get a duplicate copy of my car insurance policy? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can download the PDF version of your car insurance policy via our IL TakeCare App. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">What do I do with my car insurance policy if I sell my car? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can transfer your car insurance to the new owner. </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accord-row">
          <h3 class="text strong-txt accord-title">How can I transfer car insurance to the buyer of my car? </h3>
          <div class="accord-data mt-5">
            <p class="text">You can transfer your car insurance to the new owner.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

